  "Description": {
    "Cost": 729328,
    "UIName": "Locust",
    "Id": "chassisdef_locust_LCT-1VM",
    "Name": "Locust",
    "Details": "Piloted by the mercenary Jostein Mouwen, the Locust 1VM is a Mech with a bloody legend. Deployed among the Rim Worlds occupation forces on Terra, the 1VM has seen combat against numerous resistance groups and SLDF survivors. Originally a standard model LCT-1V, Mouwen has used a combination of looted equipment and battlefield salvage to upgrade his LCT-1V into a murderous Infantry hunter. Retaining the standard armor and heat sinks of the 1V model, Mouwen incorporated an XL Engine and a pair of Small Pulse Lasers taken from a downed LCT-1VB. The left over free weight is devoted to a third Machine Gun and a TAG. A Supercharger allows the mercenary to outrun real opponents.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
